{"ref":"BDB, עוּז","hw":"עוּז","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עוּז</span>], <span dir=\"rtl\">עוֹז</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. take</strong> or <strong>seek refuge (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">عوذ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">عَاذَ</span> <em>take refuge, seek protection</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">مَعَاذٌ</span> <em>a refuge</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעוֹז בְּמָעוֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.2\">Is 30:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחְסוֹת בְּ</span>).<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  <em>bring into safety,</em> Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵעִ֫יזוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.31\">Is 10:31</a>, obj. om., and so Imv. mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעִ֫יזוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.6\">Je 4:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעִ֫זוּ מִקֶּרֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.1\">6:1</a>; c. acc., ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעֵז</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:19\" href=\"/Exodus.9.19\">Ex 9:19</a>.","next":"BDB, מָעוֹז²","prev":"BDB, עוֹז"}